    "detailed_description": "Our princess has been kidnapped by a demonic wizard. Mike is not the first one who tries to save her; but he will be the last! Play against the enemies which getting harder each level, and defeat the wizard to get the princess. Also includes a secondary mode to collect beets, and a co-op mode to do this with a friend.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 20 levels to play.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>800+ achievements.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achievements with special characters like \u00e4, \u00eb, \u00e7.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 4 different enemies.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A co-op mode to play the secondary mode with a friend.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668560/extras/c9dc1cc3210441e7c1556092af572106.avif?t=1745650390\" /></div>",
